                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">🎮 OBJECTIVE</div>
                    <div>Click the coin button to earn coins! The more coins you earn, the more upgrades you can buy to automate your earnings.</div>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">💰 BASIC GAMEPLAY</div>
