                        <li>Click the large coin button to earn 1 coin per click</li>
                        <li>Watch your coin counter increase in the top center</li>
                        <li>Your progress is automatically saved every 5 seconds</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">🏪 UPGRADES & SHOP</div>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
                        <li><strong>Cursor (🖱️)</strong> - 10 coins → +1 coin/second</li>
                        <li><strong>Worker (👷)</strong> - 100 coins → +10 coins/second</li>
                        <li><strong>Factory (🏭)</strong> - 1,000 coins → +100 coins/second</li>
                        <li><strong>Bank (🏦)</strong> - 10,000 coins → +1,000 coins/second</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div style="margin-top: 8px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px;">Each upgrade costs 15% more than the last purchase!</div>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">🏆 ACHIEVEMENTS</div>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
                        <li>Unlock special achievements as you reach milestones</li>
                        <li>Check your progress in the Achievements panel</li>
                        <li>Earn achievements for clicks, coins, and upgrades</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">✨ PRESTIGE SYSTEM</div>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
                        <li>Once you earn 100,000 coins, the Prestige option unlocks</li>
                        <li>Reset your progress to gain a permanent bonus to earnings</li>
                        <li>Each prestige level gives you +1% more coins per second</li>
                        <li>Your upgrades reset, but the bonus stacks forever!</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">🎁 DAILY REWARDS</div>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
                        <li>Claim 50 bonus coins once per 24 hours</li>
                        <li>Daily rewards increase with your prestige level</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">📊 STATISTICS</div>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
                        <li>Track your total coins earned</li>
                        <li>Monitor your clicks per game</li>
                        <li>Check coins per second (CPS) generation</li>
                        <li>See your playtime statistics</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">⚙️ FEATURES</div>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
                        <li><strong>🌙 Dark Mode</strong> - Toggle between light and dark themes</li>
                        <li><strong>🎨 Themes</strong> - Choose from multiple color schemes</li>
                        <li><strong>📱 Responsive</strong> - Play on desktop or mobile</li>
                        <li><strong>💾 Auto-Save</strong> - Your progress saves automatically</li>
                        <li><strong>🔊 Sound Effects</strong> - Enjoy immersive audio feedback</li>
                        <li><strong>✨ Animations</strong> - Watch particles and floating text</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">💡 TIPS & TRICKS</div>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
                        <li>Focus on upgrades - passive income is key!</li>
                        <li>Each upgrade level gets more expensive, plan ahead</li>
                        <li>Don't forget to claim your daily rewards</li>
                        <li>Use Prestige to get permanent bonuses for your next run</li>
                        <li>Come back after some time - you'll earn coins offline!</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 2px solid var(--border);">
                    <div style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">About the App</div>
                    <div style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8;">
                        <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">App created by: <span style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold;">Inaaya Tanwir</span></div>
                        <div>App name: <span style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: bold;">Coin Clicker Empire</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button id="closeHowToPlayBtn" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 15px;">Close</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // ========== GAME STATE ==========
        const gameState = {
            coins: 0,
            totalEarned: 0,
            totalClicks: 0,
            cps: 0,
            startTime: Date.now(),
            prestigeLevel: 0,
            prestigeBonus: 0,
            lastDailyReward: 0,
            theme: 'default',
            darkMode: true,
            upgrades: {
                cursor: { owned: 0, basePrice: 10, priceMultiplier: 1.15, cps: 1 },
                worker: { owned: 0, basePrice: 100, priceMultiplier: 1.15, cps: 10 },
                factory: { owned: 0, basePrice: 1000, priceMultiplier: 1.15, cps: 100 },
                bank: { owned: 0, basePrice: 10000, priceMultiplier: 1.15, cps: 1000 }
            },
            achievements: {
                firstClick: false,
                coins100: false,
                coins1000: false,
                coins10000: false,
                firstUpgrade: false,
                coins100000: false,
                coins1000000: false
            }
        };

        // ========== DOM ELEMENTS ==========
        const coinButton = document.getElementById('coinButton');
        const coinCountDisplay = document.getElementById('coinCount');
        const cpsValueDisplay = document.getElementById('cpsValue');
        const upgradesGrid = document.getElementById('upgradesGrid');
        const achievementsContainer = document.getElementById('achievementsContainer');
        const darkModeBtn = document.getElementById('darkModeBtn');
        const themeBtn = document.getElementById('themeBtn');
        const resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn');
        const exportBtn = document.getElementById('exportBtn');
        const confirmModal = document.getElementById('confirmModal');
        const themeModal = document.getElementById('themeModal');

        // ========== UPGRADE DEFINITIONS ==========
        const upgradeDefs = [
            { key: 'cursor', name: 'Cursor', icon: '🖱️' },
            { key: 'worker', name: 'Worker', icon: '👷' },
            { key: 'factory', name: 'Factory', icon: '🏭' },
            { key: 'bank', name: 'Bank', icon: '🏦' }
        ];

        // ========== ACHIEVEMENT DEFINITIONS ==========
        const achievementDefs = [
            { key: 'firstClick', name: 'First Click', icon: '👆', condition: () => gameState.totalClicks >= 1 },
            { key: 'coins100', name: '100 Coins', icon: '💯', condition: () => gameState.totalEarned >= 100 },
            { key: 'coins1000', name: '1K Coins', icon: '🎯', condition: () => gameState.totalEarned >= 1000 },
            { key: 'coins10000', name: '10K Coins', icon: '🔥', condition: () => gameState.totalEarned >= 10000 },
            { key: 'firstUpgrade', name: 'First Upgrade', icon: '⭐', condition: () => Object.values(gameState.upgrades).some(u => u.owned > 0) },
            { key: 'coins100000', name: '100K Coins', icon: '👑', condition: () => gameState.totalEarned >= 100000 },
            { key: 'coins1000000', name: '1M Coins', icon: '💎', condition: () => gameState.totalEarned >= 1000000 }
        ];

        // ========== UTILITIES ==========
        function formatNumber(num) {
            if (num >= 1e9) return (num / 1e9).toFixed(1) + 'B';
            if (num >= 1e6) return (num / 1e6).toFixed(1) + 'M';
            if (num >= 1e3) return (num / 1e3).toFixed(1) + 'K';
            return Math.floor(num);
        }

        function getUpgradePrice(upgrade) {
            return Math.floor(gameState.upgrades[upgrade].basePrice * Math.pow(gameState.upgrades[upgrade].priceMultiplier, gameState.upgrades[upgrade].owned));
        }

        function saveGame() {
            localStorage.setItem('coinClickerEmpireSave', JSON.stringify(gameState));
        }

        function loadGame() {
            const saved = localStorage.getItem('coinClickerEmpireSave');
            if (saved) {
                Object.assign(gameState, JSON.parse(saved));
                // Calculate offline progress
                const timeSinceLastSave = (Date.now() - (gameState.lastSaveTime || Date.now())) / 1000;
                const offlineCoins = Math.min(gameState.cps * timeSinceLastSave, gameState.cps * 3600); // Max 1 hour offline
                if (offlineCoins > 0) {
                    gameState.coins += offlineCoins;
                    gameState.totalEarned += offlineCoins;
                    showNotification('Offline Progress', `Earned ${formatNumber(offlineCoins)} coins while away!`);
                }
                gameState.lastSaveTime = Date.now();
            }
        }

        function showNotification(title, text) {
            const notification = document.createElement('div');
            notification.className = 'notification';
            notification.innerHTML = `<div class="notification-title">${title}</div><div class="notification-text">${text}</div>`;
            document.body.appendChild(notification);
            setTimeout(() => notification.remove(), 3000);
        }

        function createFloatingText(x, y, text) {
            const floatingText = document.createElement('div');
            floatingText.className = 'floating-text';
            floatingText.textContent = text;
            floatingText.style.left = x + 'px';
            floatingText.style.top = y + 'px';
            document.body.appendChild(floatingText);
            setTimeout(() => floatingText.remove(), 1000);
        }

        function createParticle(x, y) {
            const particle = document.createElement('div');
            particle.className = 'floating-particle';
            particle.textContent = '✨';
            particle.style.left = x + 'px';
            particle.style.top = y + 'px';
            particle.style.fontSize = Math.random() * 20 + 10 + 'px';
            particle.style.animation = `floatUp ${0.8 + Math.random() * 0.4}s ease-out forwards`;
            particle.style.opacity = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.5;
            document.getElementById('particleContainer').appendChild(particle);
            setTimeout(() => particle.remove(), 1200);
        }

        function playSound(type) {
            const audioContext = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();
            const oscillator = audioContext.createOscillator();
            const gainNode = audioContext.createGain();
            
            oscillator.connect(gainNode);
            gainNode.connect(audioContext.destination);
            
            if (type === 'click') {
                oscillator.frequency.value = 800;
                gainNode.gain.setValueAtTime(0.3, audioContext.currentTime);
                gainNode.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, audioContext.currentTime + 0.1);
                oscillator.start(audioContext.currentTime);
                oscillator.stop(audioContext.currentTime + 0.1);
            } else if (type === 'upgrade') {
                oscillator.frequency.value = 1200;
                gainNode.gain.setValueAtTime(0.2, audioContext.currentTime);
                gainNode.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, audioContext.currentTime + 0.2);
                oscillator.start(audioContext.currentTime);
                oscillator.stop(audioContext.currentTime + 0.2);
            } else if (type === 'achievement') {
                oscillator.frequency.value = 1600;
                gainNode.gain.setValueAtTime(0.2, audioContext.currentTime);
                gainNode.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.01, audioContext.currentTime + 0.3);
                oscillator.start(audioContext.currentTime);
                oscillator.stop(audioContext.currentTime + 0.3);
            }
        }

        // ========== GAME LOGIC ==========
        function addCoins(amount) {
            gameState.coins += amount;
            gameState.totalEarned += amount;
            updateDisplay();
            checkAchievements();
        }

        function click(event) {
            gameState.totalClicks++;
            addCoins(1);
            playSound('click');
            
            const rect = coinButton.getBoundingClientRect();
            const x = event.clientX || rect.left + rect.width / 2;
            const y = event.clientY || rect.top + rect.height / 2;
            
            createFloatingText(x, y, '+1');
            for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
                createParticle(x + Math.random() * 40 - 20, y + Math.random() * 40 - 20);
            }
            
            checkAchievements();
        }

        function buyUpgrade(upgradeKey) {
            const upgrade = gameState.upgrades[upgradeKey];
            const price = getUpgradePrice(upgradeKey);
            
            if (gameState.coins >= price) {
                gameState.coins -= price;
                upgrade.owned++;
                gameState.cps += upgrade.cps;
                playSound('upgrade');
                showNotification('Upgrade Purchased!', `You now have ${upgrade.owned} ${upgradeKey}(s)`);
                updateDisplay();
                checkAchievements();
                
                if (upgrade.owned === 1) {
                    checkAchievements();
                }
            }
        }

        function calculateCPS() {
            let cps = 0;
            Object.values(gameState.upgrades).forEach(upgrade => {
                cps += upgrade.owned * upgrade.cps;
            });
            // Apply prestige bonus
            cps *= (1 + gameState.prestigeBonus / 100);
            return cps;
        }

        function updateDisplay() {
            gameState.cps = calculateCPS();
            
            coinCountDisplay.textContent = formatNumber(gameState.coins);
            cpsValueDisplay.textContent = formatNumber(gameState.cps);
            
            document.getElementById('totalEarned').textContent = formatNumber(gameState.totalEarned);
            document.getElementById('totalClicks').textContent = gameState.totalClicks;
            
            const timePlayed = Math.floor((Date.now() - gameState.startTime) / 60000);
            document.getElementById('timePlayed').textContent = timePlayed + 'm';
            
            // Update upgrade buttons
            upgradeDefs.forEach(upgradeDef => {
                const upgrade = gameState.upgrades[upgradeDef.key];
                const price = getUpgradePrice(upgradeDef.key);
                const button = document.querySelector(`[data-upgrade="${upgradeDef.key}"]`);
                
                if (button) {
                    button.disabled = gameState.coins < price;
                    button.innerHTML = `
                        <div class="upgrade-header">
                            <span class="upgrade-name">${upgradeDef.icon} ${upgradeDef.name}</span>
                            <span class="upgrade-count">×${upgrade.owned}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="upgrade-info">+${formatNumber(upgrade.cps)}/s</div>
                        <div class="upgrade-cost">Cost: ${formatNumber(price)}</div>
                    `;
                }
            });
            
            saveGame();
        }

        function checkAchievements() {
            achievementDefs.forEach(achDef => {
                if (!gameState.achievements[achDef.key] && achDef.condition()) {
                    gameState.achievements[achDef.key] = true;
                    playSound('achievement');
                    showNotification('Achievement Unlocked!', achDef.name);
                    updateAchievements();
                    saveGame();
                }
            });
            
            // Update achievement progress
            const nextAchievement = achievementDefs.find(a => !gameState.achievements[a.key]);
            if (nextAchievement) {
                let progress = 0;
                if (nextAchievement.key.includes('coins')) {
                    const targetCoins = parseInt(nextAchievement.key.replace('coins', ''));
                    progress = (gameState.totalEarned / targetCoins) * 100;
                }
                document.getElementById('achievementProgress').style.width = Math.min(progress, 100) + '%';
            } else {
                document.getElementById('achievementProgress').style.width = '100%';
            }
        }

        function updateAchievements() {
            achievementsContainer.innerHTML = achievementDefs.map(achDef => `
                <div class="achievement ${gameState.achievements[achDef.key] ? 'unlocked' : ''}" 
                     data-tooltip="${achDef.name}"
                     title="${achDef.name}">
                    ${achDef.icon}
                </div>
            `).join('');
        }

        function updatePrestige() {
            const prestigePanel = document.getElementById('prestigePanel');
            if (gameState.totalEarned >= 100000) {
                prestigePanel.style.display = 'block';
                document.getElementById('prestigeLevel').textContent = gameState.prestigeLevel;
                document.getElementById('prestigeBonus').textContent = (gameState.prestigeBonus).toFixed(1);
            }
        }

        function applyPrestige() {
            const gain = Math.floor(gameState.totalEarned / 100000);
            if (gain > 0) {
                gameState.prestigeLevel++;
                gameState.prestigeBonus += gain * 1;
                gameState.coins = 0;
                gameState.totalEarned = 0;
                gameState.totalClicks = 0;
                Object.values(gameState.upgrades).forEach(u => {
                    u.owned = 0;
                });
                gameState.achievements = Object.keys(gameState.achievements).reduce((acc, key) => {
                    acc[key] = false;
                    return acc;
                }, {});
                gameState.cps = 0;
                
                showNotification('Prestige!', `You gained ${gain}% bonus!`);
                updateDisplay();
                updateAchievements();
                updatePrestige();
            }
        }

        function claimDailyReward() {
            const now = Date.now();
            const lastReward = gameState.lastDailyReward || 0;
            
            if (now - lastReward >= 86400000) { // 24 hours
                const reward = 50 * (1 + gameState.prestigeLevel * 0.1); // Prestige increases reward
                addCoins(reward);
                gameState.lastDailyReward = now;
                updateDailyReward();
                showNotification('Daily Reward!', `You claimed ${formatNumber(reward)} bonus coins!`);
            }
        }

        function updateDailyReward() {
            const dailyPanel = document.getElementById('dailyRewardPanel');
            const now = Date.now();
            const lastReward = gameState.lastDailyReward || 0;
            const timeSinceReward = now - lastReward;
            const canClaim = timeSinceReward >= 86400000;
            
            if (!canClaim) {
                const timeUntil = 86400000 - timeSinceReward;
                const hours = Math.floor(timeUntil / 3600000);
                const minutes = Math.floor((timeUntil % 3600000) / 60000);
                dailyPanel.style.display = 'block';
                
                const status = document.getElementById('dailyRewardStatus');
                status.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="daily-reward-timer">Next reward in ${hours}h ${minutes}m</div>
                    <button disabled style="width: 100%; margin-top: 8px;">Come back later</button>
                `;
            } else {
                dailyPanel.style.display = 'block';
                const status = document.getElementById('dailyRewardStatus');
                const reward = 50 * (1 + gameState.prestigeLevel * 0.1);
                status.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="daily-reward-amount">Claim ${formatNumber(reward)} bonus coins!</div>
                    <button id="claimRewardBtn" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 8px;">Claim</button>
                `;
                document.getElementById('claimRewardBtn').onclick = claimDailyReward;
            }
        }

        // ========== UI INITIALIZATION ==========
        function initializeUpgrades() {
            upgradesGrid.innerHTML = upgradeDefs.map(upgradeDef => `
                <button class="upgrade-card" data-upgrade="${upgradeDef.key}"></button>
            `).join('');
            
            upgradeDefs.forEach(upgradeDef => {
                const button = document.querySelector(`[data-upgrade="${upgradeDef.key}"]`);
                button.onclick = () => buyUpgrade(upgradeDef.key);
            });
        }

        function toggleDarkMode() {
            document.body.classList.toggle('light-mode');
            gameState.darkMode = !gameState.darkMode;
            saveGame();
        }

        function changeTheme(themeName) {
            document.body.className = '';
            if (themeName !== 'default') {
                document.body.classList.add('theme-' + themeName);
            }
            if (!gameState.darkMode) {
                document.body.classList.add('light-mode');
            }
            gameState.theme = themeName;
            saveGame();
            themeModal.classList.remove('active');
        }

        function showConfirmDialog(title, text, onConfirm) {
            document.getElementById('confirmTitle').textContent = title;
            document.getElementById('confirmText').textContent = text;
            
            const yes = document.getElementById('confirmYes');
            const no = document.getElementById('confirmNo');
            
            yes.onclick = () => {
                onConfirm();
                confirmModal.classList.remove('active');
            };
            
            no.onclick = () => confirmModal.classList.remove('active');
            
            confirmModal.classList.add('active');
        }

        // ========== EVENT LISTENERS ==========
        coinButton.addEventListener('click', click);
        
        document.getElementById('howToPlayBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            document.getElementById('howToPlayModal').classList.add('active');
        });
        
        document.getElementById('closeHowToPlayBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            document.getElementById('howToPlayModal').classList.remove('active');
        });
        
        darkModeBtn.addEventListener('click', toggleDarkMode);
        themeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => themeModal.classList.add('active'));

        resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            showConfirmDialog('Reset Game', 'Are you sure? This will erase all progress!', () => {
                localStorage.removeItem('coinClickerEmpireSave');
                location.reload();
            });
        });

        exportBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const save = JSON.stringify(gameState, null, 2);
            const blob = new Blob([save], { type: 'application/json' });
            const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
            const a = document.createElement('a');
            a.href = url;
            a.download = 'coin-clicker-save.json';
            a.click();
        });

        // Theme selection
        document.getElementById('themeDefault').addEventListener('click', () => changeTheme('default'));
        document.getElementById('themeNeon').addEventListener('click', () => changeTheme('neon'));
        document.getElementById('themeSunset').addEventListener('click', () => changeTheme('sunset'));
        document.getElementById('themeOcean').addEventListener('click', () => changeTheme('ocean'));

        // Prestige button
        document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            if (e.target.id === 'prestigeBtn') {
                showConfirmDialog('Prestige?', `Reset your progress to gain ${Math.floor(gameState.totalEarned / 100000)}% permanent bonus!`, applyPrestige);
            }
        });

        // ========== AUTO-SAVE AND GAME LOOP ==========
        setInterval(() => {
            gameState.coins += gameState.cps / 10; // Update 10 times per second
            updateDisplay();
        }, 100);

        setInterval(() => {
            saveGame();
        }, 5000); // Auto-save every 5 seconds

        setInterval(() => {
            updateDailyReward();
        }, 60000); // Update daily reward every minute

        // ========== INITIALIZATION ==========
        window.addEventListener('load', () => {
            loadGame();
            initializeUpgrades();
            updateDisplay();
            updateAchievements();
            updatePrestige();
            updateDailyReward();
            checkAchievements();
            
            // Apply saved theme and dark mode
            if (!gameState.darkMode) {
                document.body.classList.add('light-mode');
            }
            if (gameState.theme !== 'default') {
                document.body.classList.add('theme-' + gameState.theme);
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>